/* Intentionally empty theme for the UI Toolkit payment option picker's own panel
 * (PaymentOptionProviderPanelSettings). The picker styles itself from
 * PaymentOptionProviderModal.uss and sets its font in C#; this theme exists only so
 * the panel has one, because a PanelSettings without a theme logs
 * "No Theme Style Sheet set to PanelSettings, UI will not render properly".
 * Importing Unity's default runtime theme here would restyle the picker's buttons. */
